{
    "title": "Dave: Fast Cash & Banking",
    "description": "Take your finances to the next level with Dave. You can pocket up to $500(1), get your cash instantly(2), save on fees, and so much more.  \r\n\r\nGET $500 IN 5 MINUTES OR LESS(1)\r\nRemove extra stress with an ExtraCash\u2122 advance up to $500. There\u2019s no credit check, interest, or late fees.\r\n\r\nFor more information, please visit dave.com/extra-cash-account.\r\n\r\nEXTRACASH\u2122 101\r\nThe ExtraCash\u2122 account offers the ability to get an ExtraCash\u2122  advance up to $500 when you\u2019re in a pinch.(1) The amount of money you can take (aka your eligibility) refreshes daily. We use several data points\u2014including your income history, spending patterns, and at least 3 recurring deposits\u2014to determine your eligibility. When you take an advance, you\u2019ll agree to a settlement date to pay your outstanding balance. \r\n\r\nACCESS YOUR CASH INSTANTLY(2)\r\nYou could get up to $500 when you download Dave, link a bank account, open your Dave accounts, and transfer it to your Dave Checking account. You\u2019ll save 40% on express fees.(3) And with your Dave Debit Mastercard\u00ae, you\u2019ll be shopping in no time.\r\n\r\nEARN 4.00% APY(4)\r\nGrow your cash with our high annual percentage yield. Just add money to your Dave Checking or Goals account to start earning. \r\n\r\nGET PAID EARLY\t\r\nReceive your paycheck up to 2 days early when you set up direct deposit.(5)\r\n\r\nSAY GOODBYE TO PESKY FEES\r\nDon\u2019t worry, we\u2019ll never hit you with hidden fees. You can even skip ATM fees at 38K MoneyPass locations.(6)\r\n\r\nSAVE EFFORTLESSLY\r\nA vacation, down payment, or brighter future\u2014own your savings journey with a Goals account. You can even set up recurring deposits to build your savings steadily.\r\n\r\nMAKE MONEY ON THE SIDE\r\nExplore our Side Hustle board and easily apply for part-time roles, gig jobs, remote work, and more. Or take Surveys that pay out instantly to your Dave Checking account.\r\n\r\nOUR MEMBERSHIP FEE\r\nThere\u2019s a small monthly membership fee that gives you full access to our suite of features, including ExtraCash\u2122, Goals, and Surveys\u2014another way to earn cash instantly. \r\n\r\nHAVE MORE QUESTIONS?\r\nSend us an email at support@dave.com.\r\n\r\nDisclosures related to the Dave app\r\n\r\n1-Evolve Bank and Trust, Member FDIC, provides the ExtraCash account. Advances are subject to eligibility requirements, and are provided as an overdraft, which causes the ExtraCash account to have a negative balance. Express fees apply to instant transfers to a Dave Checking Account. Transfers to other accounts will take longer. The average approved advance is $160 (typically approved in 5 min), updated quarterly based on the prior 6 months. See the Dave ExtraCash\u2122 Deposit Agreement and Disclosures for details.\r\n\r\n2-Express delivery fees apply to instant transfers. \r\n\r\n3-Express fees to transfer an ExtraCash\u2122 advance to a Dave Checking account are 3% (minimum $3) of your total advance amount, which is 40% less than the express fee of 5% (minimum $5) to transfer to an external debit card.\r\n\r\n4-Rates accurate as of 8/1/23. The interest rates and annual percentage yields (APY) are variable and may change at any time at our discretion. No minimum deposit or minimum balance requirements. Fees could reduce earnings on the account. Access to select services may involve a membership fee. \r\n\r\n5-Early access to direct deposit funds depends on timing and availability of the payroll files sent from the payer. These funds can be available up to 2 business days in advance of the scheduled payment date.\r\n\r\n6-Out of network fees may apply.\r\n\r\nGeneral Terms\r\nSee the Dave Checking Deposit Agreement and Disclosures, Dave Goals Deposit Agreement and Disclosures, and the Dave ExtraCash\u2122 Deposit Agreement and Disclosures for account terms and fees.\r\n\r\nDesigned by Dave, not a bank. Evolve Bank & Trust, Member FDIC, provides banking services and issues the Dave Debit Card, through a license from Mastercard\u00ae.\r\n\r\nAll trademarks and brand names belong to their respective owners and do not represent endorsements of any kind. Physical address: 1265 S Cochran Ave, Los Angeles, CA, 90019.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Take your finances to the next level with Dave. You can pocket up to $500(1), get your cash instantly(2), save on fees, and so much more.  <br><br>GET $500 IN 5 MINUTES OR LESS(1)<br>Remove extra stress with an ExtraCash\u2122 advance up to $500. There\u2019s no credit check, interest, or late fees.<br><br>For more information, please visit dave.com/extra-cash-account.<br><br>EXTRACASH\u2122 101<br>The ExtraCash\u2122 account offers the ability to get an ExtraCash\u2122  advance up to $500 when you\u2019re in a pinch.(1) The amount of money you can take (aka your eligibility) refreshes daily. We use several data points\u2014including your income history, spending patterns, and at least 3 recurring deposits\u2014to determine your eligibility. When you take an advance, you\u2019ll agree to a settlement date to pay your outstanding balance. <br><br>ACCESS YOUR CASH INSTANTLY(2)<br>You could get up to $500 when you download Dave, link a bank account, open your Dave accounts, and transfer it to your Dave Checking account. You\u2019ll save 40% on express fees.(3) And with your Dave Debit Mastercard\u00ae, you\u2019ll be shopping in no time.<br><br>EARN 4.00% APY(4)<br>Grow your cash with our high annual percentage yield. Just add money to your Dave Checking or Goals account to start earning. <br><br>GET PAID EARLY\t<br>Receive your paycheck up to 2 days early when you set up direct deposit.(5)<br><br>SAY GOODBYE TO PESKY FEES<br>Don\u2019t worry, we\u2019ll never hit you with hidden fees. You can even skip ATM fees at 38K MoneyPass locations.(6)<br><br>SAVE EFFORTLESSLY<br>A vacation, down payment, or brighter future\u2014own your savings journey with a Goals account. You can even set up recurring deposits to build your savings steadily.<br><br>MAKE MONEY ON THE SIDE<br>Explore our Side Hustle board and easily apply for part-time roles, gig jobs, remote work, and more. Or take Surveys that pay out instantly to your Dave Checking account.<br><br>OUR MEMBERSHIP FEE<br>There\u2019s a small monthly membership fee that gives you full access to our suite of features, including ExtraCash\u2122, Goals, and Surveys\u2014another way to earn cash instantly. <br><br>HAVE MORE QUESTIONS?<br>Send us an email at support@dave.com.<br><br>Disclosures related to the Dave app<br><br>1-Evolve Bank and Trust, Member FDIC, provides the ExtraCash account. Advances are subject to eligibility requirements, and are provided as an overdraft, which causes the ExtraCash account to have a negative balance. Express fees apply to instant transfers to a Dave Checking Account. Transfers to other accounts will take longer. The average approved advance is $160 (typically approved in 5 min), updated quarterly based on the prior 6 months. See the Dave ExtraCash\u2122 Deposit Agreement and Disclosures for details.<br><br>2-Express delivery fees apply to instant transfers. <br><br>3-Express fees to transfer an ExtraCash\u2122 advance to a Dave Checking account are 3% (minimum $3) of your total advance amount, which is 40% less than the express fee of 5% (minimum $5) to transfer to an external debit card.<br><br>4-Rates accurate as of 8/1/23. The interest rates and annual percentage yields (APY) are variable and may change at any time at our discretion. No minimum deposit or minimum balance requirements. Fees could reduce earnings on the account. Access to select services may involve a membership fee. <br><br>5-Early access to direct deposit funds depends on timing and availability of the payroll files sent from the payer. These funds can be available up to 2 business days in advance of the scheduled payment date.<br><br>6-Out of network fees may apply.<br><br>General Terms<br>See the Dave Checking Deposit Agreement and Disclosures, Dave Goals Deposit Agreement and Disclosures, and the Dave ExtraCash\u2122 Deposit Agreement and Disclosures for account terms and fees.<br><br>Designed by Dave, not a bank. Evolve Bank &amp; Trust, Member FDIC, provides banking services and issues the Dave Debit Card, through a license from Mastercard\u00ae.<br><br>All trademarks and brand names belong to their respective owners and do not represent endorsements of any kind. Physical address: 1265 S Cochran Ave, Los Angeles, CA, 90019.",
